Error [E0211]: `Res` can't be copied out of the place it is read from
  --> tests/ui/copy_out_payload_in_place.jet:15:20
    |
 15 |         applied := held
    |                    ^^^^
 Why: It holds a resource, which has one cleanup owner; this position takes an owned value, so the copy and the place would both close the same resource
 Fix: Use `held` where it is, or move the place it reads with the move marker `^` when this scope owns it
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0211

